  Activity, ArrowDownRight, ArrowRight, BarChart3, Bell, BookOpen, Bot, Check, ChevronDown, CircleAlert, CircleCheck, CloudCog, Code2, GitBranch, GitCommitHorizontal, GitPullRequest, History, KeyRound, Layers3, Lightbulb, LockKeyhole, Menu, PanelLeftClose, PanelLeftOpen, Pencil, Search, Settings, ShieldAlert, SlidersHorizontal, Sparkles, Terminal, Trash2, Workflow, X, LogOut
